+Combination with trigger action
+-------------------------------
+The event trigger action can extend the utilization of this wprobe.
+
+- set_wprobe:WPEVENT:FIELD[+|-ADJUST]
+- clear_wprobe:WPEVENT[:FIELD[+|-]ADJUST]
